                throw new InvalidDataException("Veyon ç”µè„‘åå•ç¼ºå°‘æœ‰æ•ˆç”µè„‘åï¼›è¯·ä¿®å¤åå•åå†æ“ä½œã€‚");
            if (!result.Succeeded || result.Status is not { } status)
                throw new InvalidDataException($"æ— æ³•éªŒè¯â€œ{computerName}â€çš„ Agent çŠ¶æ€å’Œèº«ä»½ï¼›æœªå‘é€ç­–ç•¥ã€‚è¯·å…ˆæ ¸å¯¹è¯¥ç”µè„‘èº«ä»½å¹¶åˆ·æ–°çŠ¶æ€ã€‚");
            if (!SupportsPolicyCompareAndSet(status.AgentVersion))
                throw new InvalidDataException($"â€œ{computerName}â€çš„ Agent ç‰ˆæœ¬ä¸æ”¯æŒç­–ç•¥å†²çªä¿æŠ¤ï¼›æœªå‘é€ç­–ç•¥ã€‚è¯·å…ˆæ›´æ–°å­¦ç”Ÿ Agentã€‚");
            if (website) websiteRevisions!.Add(result.Target, status.Website.Revision);
            if (application)
            {
                if (status.Application is not { Supported: true, Revision: { } applicationRevision })
                    throw new InvalidDataException($"â€œ{computerName}â€æœªæŠ¥å‘Šå—æ”¯æŒçš„åº”ç”¨é™åˆ¶ç‰ˆæœ¬ï¼›æœªå‘é€ç­–ç•¥ã€‚è¯·æ›´æ–°å­¦ç”Ÿ Agent åé‡è¯•ã€‚");
                applicationRevisions!.Add(result.Target, applicationRevision);
            }
            if (system)
            {
                if (status.SystemPolicy is not { Supported: true, Pending: false, Revision: { } systemRevision })
                    throw new InvalidDataException($"â€œ{computerName}â€ç³»ç»Ÿé™åˆ¶çŠ¶æ€æœªçŸ¥æˆ–ä»å¾…å¤æ ¸ï¼›æœªå‘é€ç­–ç•¥ã€‚è¯·å…ˆæ£€æŸ¥å­¦ç”Ÿç”µè„‘çŠ¶æ€ã€‚");
